  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 35 + 7 × 12 − 6 ÷ 2 = 6.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) - and ×**\n\nGiven: 35 + 7 × 12 − 6 ÷ 2 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 35 + 7 - 12 × __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 35 + 7 - __**12 × 3**__ = 6\n\n⇒ **__35 + 7__** - 36 = 6\n\n⇒ __**42 - 36**__ = 6\n\n⇒ **6 = 6**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) - and ÷\n\nGiven: 35 + 7 × 12 − 6 ÷ 2 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 35 + 7 × __**12 ÷ 6**__ - 2 = 6\n\n⇒ 35 + __**7 × **____2__ - 2 = 6\n\n⇒ __**35 + 14**__ - 2 = 6\n\n⇒ __**49 - 2**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 47 ≠ 6\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\nGiven: 35 + 7 × 12 − 6 ÷ 2 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 35 × 7 + 12 − __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 6\n\n⇒ __**35 ×**____** 7**__ + 12 − 3 = 6\n\n⇒ __**245**____** + 12**__ − 3 = 6\n\n⇒ 257 - 3 = 6\n\n⇒ 254 ≠ 6\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) × and ÷\n\nGiven: 35 + 7 × 12 − 6 ÷ 2 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 35 + __**7 ÷ 12**__ − 6 × 2 = 6\n\n⇒ 35 + 0.59 − __**6 **____**×**____** 2**__ = 6\n\n⇒ __**35 + 0.59**__ − 12 = 6\n\n⇒ __**35.59 - 12**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 23.59 ≠ 6\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
